#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "Persiapan {#setup}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Begin by importing the necessary libraries and defining the helper functions that build the quantum circuits for the LSH time evolution. There are three core circuit-building functions:\n"
msgstr "Mulai dengan mengimpor library yang diperlukan dan mendefinisikan fungsi-fungsi bantu yang membangun sirkuit kuantum untuk evolusi waktu LSH. Ada tiga fungsi inti pembangun sirkuit:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`pair_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Implements the two-qubit unitary $U_I$ for the approximate interaction Hamiltonian between neighboring sites. The gate decomposition is: $\\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to R_z(-c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to \\text{CNOT}$.\n"
msgstr "**`pair_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Mengimplementasikan unitary dua-qubit $U_I$ untuk Hamiltonian interaksi aproksimasi antara situs-situs tetangga. Dekomposisi gate-nya adalah: $\\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to R_z(-c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to \\text{CNOT}$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`electric_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Implements the two-qubit unitary $U_E$ for the approximate electric field energy at each site. The gate decomposition is: $X \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(-\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to X$.\n"
msgstr "**`electric_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Mengimplementasikan unitary dua-qubit $U_E$ untuk energi medan elektrik aproksimasi di setiap situs. Dekomposisi gate-nya adalah: $X \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(-\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to X$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`construct_circuit`**: Assembles the full Trotterized circuit, layering interaction, electric, and mass terms with SWAP gates to manage qubit connectivity.\n"
msgstr "**`construct_circuit`**: Merakit sirkuit Trotterisasi penuh, menumpuk suku interaksi, elektrik, dan massa dengan gate SWAP untuk mengelola konektivitas qubit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Small-scale simulator example {#small-scale-simulator-example}"
msgstr "Contoh simulator skala-kecil {#small-scale-simulator-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, demonstrate the workflow at small scale using a six-site lattice (12 qubits), so that you can verify circuit construction and understand the physical observables before running on hardware.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, demonstrasikan alur kerja pada skala kecil menggunakan lattice enam-situs (12 qubit), sehingga kamu bisa memverifikasi konstruksi sirkuit dan memahami observabel fisis sebelum menjalankannya pada hardware.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Memetakan input klasik ke masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the physical parameters matching the weak-coupling regime studied in the paper ($x = 100$, $m/g = 1$). The derived circuit parameters are:\n"
msgstr "Definisikan parameter fisis yang sesuai dengan rezim kopling lemah yang dipelajari dalam paper ($x = 100$, $m/g = 1$). Parameter sirkuit yang diturunkan adalah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$c = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot x = 0.15$ (interaction parameter)\n"
msgstr "$c = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot x = 0.15$ (parameter interaksi)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\theta = -\\delta_\\tau (\\bar{n}_l/2 + 3/4) = 0.01$ (electric field phase)\n"
msgstr "$\\theta = -\\delta_\\tau (\\bar{n}_l/2 + 3/4) = 0.01$ (fase medan elektrik)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\tilde{m} = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot \\mu = 0.03$ (mass parameter)\n"
msgstr "$\\tilde{m} = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot \\mu = 0.03$ (parameter massa)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each Trotter step count, build **two circuits**: one initializing a meson at the center (`inverse_mid=True`) and one preparing the strong-coupling vacuum (`inverse_mid=False`). The differential measurement protocol subtracts the vacuum evolution to isolate the hadron signal.\n"
msgstr "Untuk setiap jumlah langkah Trotter, buat **dua sirkuit**: satu menginisialisasi meson di tengah (`inverse_mid=True`) dan satu menyiapkan vakum kopling-kuat (`inverse_mid=False`). Protokol pengukuran diferensial mengurangkan evolusi vakum untuk mengisolasi sinyal hadron.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/loop-string-hadron-dynamics/extracted-outputs/step1-circuits-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/loop-string-hadron-dynamics/extracted-outputs/step1-circuits-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimalkan masalah untuk eksekusi pada hardware kuantum {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the observables: single-qubit $Z$ measurements on every qubit. From $\\langle Z \\rangle$ you can extract occupation probabilities and then the staggered fermion number $n_f(r)$ at each lattice site $r$.\n"
msgstr "Definisikan observabel: pengukuran $Z$ satu-qubit pada setiap qubit. Dari $\\langle Z \\rangle$ kamu bisa mengekstrak probabilitas okupasi lalu bilangan fermion staggered $n_f(r)$ pada setiap situs lattice $r$.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `StatevectorEstimator` for exact noiseless simulation at small scale.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `StatevectorEstimator` untuk simulasi eksak tanpa noise pada skala kecil.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Post-proses dan kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik yang diinginkan {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert expectation values to the staggered fermion number $n_f(r, t)$ and apply the differential measurement protocol (meson $-$ vacuum) to produce the hadron propagation heatmap. This reproduces the structure of Figure 3 from the reference paper: lattice site $r$ on the x-axis, Trotter step (time) $t$ on the y-axis, and $n_f(r,t)$ as the color scale.\n"
msgstr "Konversikan nilai ekspektasi ke bilangan fermion staggered $n_f(r, t)$ dan terapkan protokol pengukuran diferensial (meson $-$ vakum) untuk menghasilkan heatmap propagasi hadron. Ini mereproduksi struktur Gambar 3 dari paper referensi: situs lattice $r$ pada sumbu-x, langkah Trotter (waktu) $t$ pada sumbu-y, dan $n_f(r,t)$ sebagai skala warna.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
